This approach still allows conflicts within each Vec though. The real challenge is preventing incompatible variants from coexisting - like having both `Release` and `Debug` in the same cargo params. I could make each "slot" explicit with Option fields to enforce mutual exclusivity at the type level, ensuring the compiler prevents invalid combinations.

```rust
